ting", "type": "skill"}, {"content": "Listening", "type": "skill"}]}], "id": 9, "stimuli_ids": []}, {"template_override": 1, "type": "RSLT", "questions": [{"responses": [{"_data": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}], "id": 0, "correct": 0, "selected": 0}, {"_data": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}], "id": 1, "correct": 1, "selected": 0}], "_data": [{"type": "question", "contents": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}]}], "id": 0}], "_data": [{"type": "instructions", "contents": []}, {"type": "group", "contents": [{"content": "Quiz", "type": "group_name"}]}, {"content": {"allowed_attempts": 2, "incorrect_feedback": [{"content": "Whoops! Something important is missing.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Maybe next time...", "type": "text"}], "correct_feedback": "Correct!", "attempt_feedback": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}, {"content": "", "type": "text"}]}, "type": "feedback"}], "id": 10, "stimuli_ids": []}, {"template_override": 1, "type": "DWS", "questions": [{"responses": [{"_data": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}], "id": 0, "correct": 1, "selected": 0}], "_data": [{"type": "question", "contents": [{"content": "engenn10le03ob04re7pdf01.pdf", "type": "pdf"}]}], "id": 0}], "_data": [{"type": "instructions", "contents": [{"content": " Prepare your own elevator pitch.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "group", "contents": [{"content": "Take Away", "type": "group_name"}]}, {"content": {"allowed_attempts": 2, "incorrect_feedback": [{"content": "Whoops! Something important is missing.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Maybe next time...", "type": "text"}], "correct_feedback": "Correct!", "attempt_feedback": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}, {"content": "", "type": "text"}]}, "type": "feedback"}, {"type": "learning_skills", "contents": [{"content": "Reading", "type": "skill"}, {"content": "Writing", "type": "skill"}, {"content": "Speaking", "type": "skill"}]}, {"type": "post_instructions", "contents": [{"content": "Instructions: Complete the following steps. Fill in the Self-Assessment.", "type": "text"}]}], "id": 11, "stimuli_ids": []}], "type": "scholar", "stimuli": [{"template_override": 1, "type": "welcome", "_data": [], "contents": [{}], "id": 0}, {"template_override": 1, "type": "audio", "id": 1, "title": "", "contents": [{"type": "slideshow", "value": {"audiosrc": "engenn10le03ob04re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn10le03ob04re2img05.jpg", "images": [{"image": "engenn10le03ob04re2img05.jpg", "text": "", "id": 0, "time": "0"}, {"image": "engenn10le03ob04re2img05.jpg", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Adam</span>: Kristi, can you help me for a sec?\n<Br/> <span class=\"strong\">Kristi</span>: Sure, what's up?\n<Br/> <span class=\"strong\">Adam</span>: My elevator pitch needs polishing. That's what they call the little speech you say to someone as soon as you have the right opportunity, like during an interview or at the coffee break at a conference. I have been practicing ever since I met the headhunter. Do you want to hear it?\n<Br/> <span class=\"strong\">Kristi</span>: Absolutely!", "id": 1, "time": "100"}, {"image": "engenn10le03ob04re2img06.jpg", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Adam</span>: OK, here goes:  I'm a communications professional with a knack for persuasive storytelling. While being new to professional writing, I have been published in 5 medium-circulation publications over the last year. Before doing that, I also worked for an independent paper and an award-winning magazine known as <span class=\"italic\">The News Gazette</span>.  I want to help express ideas through compelling and relatable stories while using the power of social media.\n<Br/> <span class=\"strong\">Kristi</span>:  Wow!  That sounds amazing!\n<Br/> <span class=\"strong\">Adam</span>: Thanks! Do you have any suggestions for improvement? Do you think it needs to be shortened?\n</br><span class=\"strong\">Kristi</span>: No, it doesn't need shortening, but I think you could say something about your abilities.", "id": 2, "time": "20000"}, {"image": "engenn10le03ob04re2img07.jpg", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Adam</span>: OK, something like:  My core skill sets includes finding original angles and adding a touching human element to all stories.\n<Br/> <span class=\"strong\">Kristi</span>: You are repeating yourself there, I think. How about something like more practical, like: My core skill set includes using a variety of editing software programs.\n<Br/> <span class=\"strong\">Adam</span>:  Good suggestion.\n<Br/> <span class=\"strong\">Kristi</span>: I also think your ultimate  goal needs emphasizing.\n<Br/> <span class=\"strong\">Adam</span>:  Yes, I agree that needs to be emphasized. How about: Because I'm inspired by international people and cultures, I'm looking for a position that uses my people skills as well as my writing skills to engage others in cultural and meaningful exchanges.\n<Br/> <span class=\"strong\">Kristi</span>:  You're hired!", "id": 3, "time": "57000"}]}}], "_data": []}], "_data": [{"type": "lab_options", "contents": [{"content": true, "type": "has_nav"}, {"content": true, "type": "has_exercise_controls"}]}], "id": 0}], "_data": [{"type": "metadata", "contents": [{"content": "Looking for a Job", "type": "lesson_name"}, {"content": "Going for It!", "type": "unit_name"}, {"content": 4, "type": "position"}, {"content": "stub", "type": "origin"}, {"content": 3, "type": "lesson"}, {"content": "B2.2", "type": "level"}]}, {"type": "achievment_test", "contents": [{"content": "false", "type": "test"}]}, {"type": "objectives", "contents": [{"content": "Discuss factual and abstract information about common everyday or job related topics in both work and social contexts appropriate for the interlocutor.", "type": "primary"}, {"content": "Understands the main ideas and specific information of complex text on both concrete and abstract topics in written texts in social and work contexts.", "type": "secondary_1"}, {"content": "Understands the main ideas and specific information of complex text on both concrete and abstract topics in written texts in social and work contexts.", "type": "secondary_2"}, {"content": "Understands the main ideas and specific information of complex text on both concrete and abstract topics in written texts in social and work contexts.", "type": "secondary_3"}, {"content": "Understands the main ideas and specific information of complex text on both concrete and abstract topics in written texts in social and work contexts.", "type": "secondary_4"}, {"content": "Understands the main ideas and specific information of complex text on both concrete and abstract topics in written texts in social and work contexts.", "type": "secondary_5"}, {"content": "Understands the main ideas and specific information of complex text on both concrete and abstract topics in written texts in social and work contexts.", "type": "secondary_6"}, {"content": "Understands the main ideas and specific information of complex text on both concrete and abstract topics in written texts in social and work contexts.", "type": "secondary_7"}, {"content": "Understands the main ideas and specific information of complex text on both concrete and abstract topics in written texts in social and work contexts.", "type": "secondary_8"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "to polish", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to improve something", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: My elevator pitch needs polishing.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn10le03ob04aud01", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"content": "These are words you use when you prepare an elevator pitch.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "storytelling", "type": "name"}, {"content": "the art of telling or writing stories", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I'm a communications professional with a knack for persuasive storytelling.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn10le03ob04aud02", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "improvement ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a change that makes something better in some way", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Thanks! Do you have any suggestions for improvement?", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn10le03ob04aud03", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "core", "type": "name"}, {"content": "main; major", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: My core skill sets includes finding original angles and adding a touching human element to all stories.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn10le03ob04aud04", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "ultimate", "type": "name"}, {"content": " final", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I also think your ultimate goal needs emphasizing.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn10le03ob04aud05", "type": "audio"}]}, {"content": "engenn10le03ob04re1img01.jpg", "type": "background_image"}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": "Time Clauses: <span class=\"italic\">as soon as</span>, <span class=\"italic\">ever since</span> and <span class=\"italic\">while</span>", "type": "heading"}, {"content": " You use time clauses in complex sentences. These kinds of sentences have a dependent clause and an independent clause, which are paired with a connector that indicates a specific point or period of time.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "Common time markers that act as connectors are: <span class=\"strong\">as soon as</span>, <span class=\"strong\">ever since</span> and <span class=\"strong\">while</span>. </br></br><span class=\"italic\"> <span class=\"strong\">As soon as</span></span>  refers to something that happens immediately.  </br></br>For example:</br></br><span class=\"italic\">  An elevator pitch is what they call the little speech you say to someone <span class=\"strong\">as soon as</span>  you have the right opportunity.</span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "In the above example, \u201can elevator pitch is what they call the little speech you say\u201d  is the independent clause, and the dependent clause is \u201cyou have the right opportunity\u201d. <span class=\"italic\"> <span class=\"strong\">As soon as</span></span>  is the time clause connector.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "<span class=\"italic\"><span class=\"strong\">Ever since</span> </span> refers to something that started at a particular point. </br></br> For example: </br></br><span class=\"italic\"> I have been practicing my elevator pitch <span class=\"strong\">ever since</span>  I met the headhunter. </span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "<span class=\"italic\"><span class=\"strong\">While</span> </span> refers to a period of time.</br></br>  For example:  </br></br><span class=\"italic\">I want to help express ideas through compelling and relatable stories<span class=\"strong\"> while </span> using the power of social media.</span>", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": "Linking Final Consonants to Beginning Vowels", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "When a word ends in a <span class=\"strong\">consonant sound</span>, we often move the <span class=\"strong\">consonant sound</span>  to the beginning of the next word if it starts with a<span class=\"strong\"> vowel sound</span>.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "Look at the following example:   </br></br><span class=\"italic\">turn off</span></br></br>  The first word ends with the<span class=\"strong\"> consonant sound</span>  \u201cn\u201d. The second word begins with the <span class=\"strong\">vowel sound</span>  \u201co\u201d. In conversation, these two sounds are linked.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "turn_off  </br></br>The two words now sound like one word. This is one of the reasons why native English speakers are difficult to understand.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Practice saying these phrases and sentences. Focus on linking the consonant to the vowel.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":3,\"columns\":3,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Two words</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Linked words</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\"> Example</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"needs emphasizing\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"needs_emphasizing\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">I also think your ultimate goal needs emphasizing.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"engage other\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"engage_others\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">I am looking for a position where I can engage clients with both my people and writing skills. </span>\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border\"}", "type": "table"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"content": "I identify and read sample elevator pitches.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I write an elevator pitch.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I present my elevator pitch and ask for feedback.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"content": "Choose a job you would like to have or a project you would like to start.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Go online. Find some sample elevator pitches for that job or project.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Prepare an elevator pitch you could use at an interview or when you meet someone. Write an elevator pitch of 100 - 150 words. Make sure you use powerful language.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Proofread the pitch. Make sure you use correct spelling and punctuation.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Read your elevator pitch to a partner and ask for feedback.", "type": "text"}]}]}